{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293230/extras/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1759700800\" data-has-big width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm Forever \u2013 Your Cozy, Endless Farming Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of warmth and growth. In <i>Farm Forever</i>, you\u2019ll plant and harvest crops, care for animals, and expand your homestead into the farm you\u2019ve always imagined. With seasons to enjoy and land to shape, every day brings something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d <strong>Grow &amp; Harvest</strong> \u2013 Sow seeds, nurture your crops, and bring in big harvests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 <strong>Care for Animals</strong> \u2013 Chickens, cows, and more make your farm feel alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Build Your Farm</strong> \u2013 Expand, design, and customize your land your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 <strong>Seasons &amp; Surprises</strong> \u2013 Enjoy cozy cycles of planting and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e <strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 Every farm is different, every return feels fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to relax at your own pace or chase big harvests, <i>Farm Forever</i> is a timeless experience you\u2019ll always come back to. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293230?t=1759700800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293230?t=1759700800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293230/5b9ca6a0da872ac3990c7e4651cc8110bca